<title>CHINA: GAMMON WINS $14 MLN CONTRACT IN THAILAND.</title>
<headline>GAMMON WINS $14 MLN CONTRACT IN THAILAND.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gammon Construction Ltd said on Thursday it had won a HK$109 million contract to build a nine storey Honda car showroom and maintenance centre in Bangkok, Thailand.</p>
<p>Gammon is equally owned by Jardine Pacific Ltd, a unit of Jardine Matheson Holdings Ltd, and Kvaerner ASA.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
